2. Map Assets
-------------

Only the `northamerica` map is shipped in this repository (original Shadows of War content).
OpenFront-derived community maps were removed from `assets/maps/`. See assets/maps/SOURCES.toml.

When adding OSM-derived maps, credit © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL).


