4. Game and UI Art
------------------

Avatars, splash screens, and six leader portrait sets are original AI-generated art
owned by the project (see assets/SOURCES.toml). Factory, port, defense tower, and
tactical nuke icons are original Shadows of War assets.

Remaining game sprites, HUD icons, diplomacy UI, loaders, and six leader portrait
sets are themed procedural placeholders (AGPL-3.0-or-later). OpenFront-derived art was removed from
the repository.

See assets/SOURCES.toml for per-group provenance.


